** =================================================================
** 1. MODEL HEADING
** =================================================================
*Heading
3D Nonuniform Growth Validation - h=1/50, 320x1x16 C3D20H mesh
*Preprint, echo=NO, model=NO, history=NO, contact=NO
** UMAT: umat_growth_nh_penalty_nonuniform_C3D20H.for
** Kinematics: A = F * G^(-1)
** Growth tensor: G = diag(g(X,Z),1,1)
** g(X,Z) = lambda_G*exp[kappa(X)*Z]
** kappa(X) = kappa0*sin(2*pi*X/L)
** Formulation: Compressible / nearly incompressible neo-Hookean UMAT with C3D20H
** Hybrid quadratic element; no C3D8R hourglass control
